globalThis.Lesson={"manifest":{"id":"s17x-r2-fcc-product-yields","sceneId":"r2","methods":["opt","ts"],"title":"催化裂化产物预测：一百公斤原料去了哪里","version":"1.2.0","updated":"2026-10-24","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"FCC把重分子转化成更轻的产品。用六项收率账看清原料与操作的影响，再用多输出回归预测整套产品组成。","sections":[{"no":1,"title":"蒸馏是分开，裂化是改变分子","html":"<p>常减压蒸馏主要按沸程分离原油；催化裂化FCC则在催化剂作用下，把较大分子转化为较小分子。重质原料与热催化剂接触后反应，产物流进入分馏和气体回收。催化剂表面的焦炭在再生器燃烧，恢复活性并提供热量，因此反应与再生相互关联。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"FCC发生化学转化；焦炭随催化剂进入再生器，与其余五项一起计入原料质量账。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"55\" width=\"115\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"67.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">重质原料</text><path d=\"M125 85 L175 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M169 81L175 85L169 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"175\" y=\"30\" width=\"140\" height=\"95\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"83.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">提升管反应</text><path d=\"M315 75 L370 75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M364 71L370 75L364 79\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"30\" width=\"145\" height=\"95\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"442.5\" y=\"83.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">分馏 / 气体回收</text><path d=\"M515 75 L570 75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M564 71L570 75L564 79\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"580\" y=\"45\">干气 / 液化气</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"80\">汽油 / 柴油 / 油浆</text><path d=\"M245 125V148H450V125\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ba7942\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"166\">结焦催化剂 → 再生 → 返回</text></g></svg><figcaption>FCC发生化学转化；焦炭随催化剂进入再生器，与其余五项一起计入原料质量账。</figcaption></figure>"},{"no":2,"title":"产品分布必须先统一质量账","html":"<p>收率是某产品质量除以进料质量。本例全部收率采用质量百分比。六项包括干气、液化气、汽油、柴油、油浆、焦炭：焦炭作为固体产物，与液体和气体共同分配原料质量。加和接近100%是检查组成预测的一道基本约束。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"收率按同一质量基准相加为100%；模型先回归，再做非负归一化。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><text x=\"18\" y=\"35\">每 100 kg 原料的六项质量分配（示意）</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"65\" width=\"28\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#616f86\"/><rect x=\"48\" y=\"65\" width=\"112\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#638bb2\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"65\" width=\"322\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#2b8980\"/><rect x=\"482\" y=\"65\" width=\"140\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#c6a666\"/><rect x=\"622\" y=\"65\" width=\"56\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#9a7980\"/><rect x=\"678\" y=\"65\" width=\"42\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#765947\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"143\">干气 4　液化气 16　汽油 46　柴油 20　油浆 8　焦炭 6 = 100%</text></g></svg><figcaption>收率按同一质量基准相加为100%；模型先回归，再做非负归一化。</figcaption></figure><p>现实装置还需对氢转移、测量误差及边界物流做完整核算；这里采用闭合六项教学体系，便于观察组成约束。</p>"},{"no":3,"title":"温度、剂油比和原料密度怎样参与预测","html":"<p>反应温度影响反应强度；剂油比是循环催化剂质量流量与原料油质量流量之比，会影响接触条件。原料密度作为一项简化性质，与温度、剂油比共同输入模型。更高温度可能增加轻产物，也可能使汽油进一步裂解，沿温度扫描，比较汽油与干气等组分的分配。</p><p>本例用线性项、二次项和交互项拟合六个输出，再将负值截为0并归一化为100%。用户可改变三个输入，看产品堆叠条和汽油温度响应曲线怎样变化。另一组54个独立测试批次用于计算每个组分的MAE，并与按原料轻重分组的历史平均组成比较。</p><p class=\"note\">先检查六项收率非负且加和为100%，再比较各项的独立测试误差。固定原料密度和剂油比，扫描温度后，比较汽油与干气等去向；固定温度再换密度，观察类别均值基线会在920 kg/m³分组边界跳变，连续回归则利用数值输入。两者同样保留54批测试误差。</p>"},{"no":4,"title":"怎样理解演示中的证据","html":"<p>180批数据为固定公式生成的教学数据，126批训练、54批测试。公式包含温度、剂油比、密度、非线性与小扰动，模型从训练批次重新拟合，不使用测试真值生成预测。当前滑块工况只显示模型与原料分类均值；独立测试真值在下方检验图中显示。两处用途分开。</p><p>专业阅读：<a href=\"https://www.eia.gov/todayinenergy/detail.php?id=9150\">EIA：FCC如何增加汽油产出</a>；<a href=\"https://www.epa.gov/sites/default/files/2019-10/documents/petro-refining-elg-study-2019.pdf\">EPA：炼油流程与各单元物流</a>。示意与教学公式为本例原创。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","steps":[{"name":"对齐原料与操作批次","do":"每批记录密度、反应温度、剂油比，并统一六项产品收率的质量基准。","effect":"180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。","trap":"按完整稳定工况分组留出。"},{"name":"学习六项产物关系","do":"用同一组输入特征分别拟合六个回归，保留二次和交互项。","effect":"每次运行得到实际拟合的系数和组成预测。","trap":"原料密度提供一项输入，产品组成还受反应条件影响。"},{"name":"施加组成约束","do":"将各预测值限制为非负并整体归一化，使六项质量百分比相加为100。","effect":"组成条闭合，显示归一化后的六项收率。","trap":"组成闭合与各产品测试误差分别核对。"},{"name":"检查变化和留出误差","do":"改温度或剂油比看响应；用测试批次真值对照预测，并与原料分类均值比较。","effect":"六项MAE、逐批检验和汽油温度曲线相互补充。","trap":"MAE采用质量收率的百分点。"}],"metrics":{"html":"<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"对齐原料与操作批次：180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"55\" width=\"170\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">训练批次</text><path d=\"M185 85 L245 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M239 81L245 85L239 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"245\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"337.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">输入与同批测量</text><path d=\"M430 85 L490 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M484 81L490 85L484 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">留出批次另行评价</text></g></svg><figcaption>对齐原料与操作批次：180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"学习六项产物关系：每次运行得到实际拟合的系数和组成预测。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"175\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">温度 / 操作 / 原料</text><path d=\"M200 85 L255 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M249 81L255 85L249 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"55\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">拟合回归系数</text><path d=\"M455 85 L505 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M499 81L505 85L499 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"505\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"615.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">各输出分别预测</text></g></svg><figcaption>学习六项产物关系：每次运行得到实际拟合的系数和组成预测。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"施加组成约束：组成条闭合，显示归一化后的六项收率。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"117.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">原始候选结果</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"365.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">约束检查</text><path d=\"M460 85 L520 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M514 81L520 85L514 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"520\" y=\"55\" width=\"205\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"622.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">可用结果 / 越界</text></g></svg><figcaption>施加组成约束：组成条闭合，显示归一化后的六项收率。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"检查变化和留出误差：六项MAE、逐批检验和汽油温度曲线相互补充。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">模型输出</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">与基线比较</text><path d=\"M450 85 L510 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M504 81L510 85L504 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"510\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">误差 / 条件 / 复核</text></g></svg><figcaption>检查变化和留出误差：六项MAE、逐批检验和汽油温度曲线相互补充。</figcaption></figure>"}},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","intro":"FCC把重分子转化成更轻的产品。用六项收率账看清原料与操作的影响，再用多输出回归预测整套产品组成。","page":"demo/index.html","height":1400}}},"figures":["<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"对齐原料与操作批次：180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"55\" width=\"170\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">训练批次</text><path d=\"M185 85 L245 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M239 81L245 85L239 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"245\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"337.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">输入与同批测量</text><path d=\"M430 85 L490 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M484 81L490 85L484 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">留出批次另行评价</text></g></svg><figcaption>对齐原料与操作批次：180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。</figcaption></figure>","<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"学习六项产物关系：每次运行得到实际拟合的系数和组成预测。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"175\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">温度 / 操作 / 原料</text><path d=\"M200 85 L255 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M249 81L255 85L249 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"55\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">拟合回归系数</text><path d=\"M455 85 L505 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M499 81L505 85L499 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"505\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"615.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">各输出分别预测</text></g></svg><figcaption>学习六项产物关系：每次运行得到实际拟合的系数和组成预测。</figcaption></figure>","<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"施加组成约束：组成条闭合，显示归一化后的六项收率。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"117.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">原始候选结果</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"365.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">约束检查</text><path d=\"M460 85 L520 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M514 81L520 85L514 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"520\" y=\"55\" width=\"205\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"622.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">可用结果 / 越界</text></g></svg><figcaption>施加组成约束：组成条闭合，显示归一化后的六项收率。</figcaption></figure>","<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"检查变化和留出误差：六项MAE、逐批检验和汽油温度曲线相互补充。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">模型输出</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">与基线比较</text><path d=\"M450 85 L510 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M504 81L510 85L504 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"510\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">误差 / 条件 / 复核</text></g></svg><figcaption>检查变化和留出误差：六项MAE、逐批检验和汽油温度曲线相互补充。</figcaption></figure>"]};
(function(){'use strict';const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),L=globalThis.Lesson;let result=null,status='idle';const scene=L.manifest.sceneId,E=globalThis[scene.toUpperCase()+'Core'];const fmt=(v,n=2)=>Number.isFinite(v)?v.toFixed(n):'—';const params=()=>Object.fromEntries(Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]')).map(x=>[x.id,+x.value]));
function setStatus(s,text){status=s;$('#status').textContent=text;$('#results').dataset.stale=String(s==='stale');$('#export').disabled=s!=='complete';}
function svg(body,aria,h=330){return '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 760 '+h+'" role="img" aria-label="'+aria+'"><g font-family="system-ui,Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#29494e">'+body+'</g></svg>';}
function txt(x,y,t,color='#29494e'){return '<text x="'+x+'" y="'+y+'" fill="'+color+'">'+t+'</text>';}
function barComparison(values,baseline,truth){const colors=['#616f86','#638bb2','#2b8980','#c6a666','#9a7980','#765947'];let labels=truth?['测试真值','回归预测','类别均值']:['回归预测','类别均值'],rows=truth?[truth,values,baseline]:[values,baseline],s='';rows.forEach((r,i)=>{let x=115,y=25+i*62;s+=txt(12,y+25,labels[i]);r.forEach((v,j)=>{let w=v*5.9;s+='<rect x="'+x+'" y="'+y+'" width="'+w+'" height="36" fill="'+colors[j]+'"><title>'+result.names[j]+' '+fmt(v)+'%</title></rect>';if(w>34)s+=txt(x+4,y+24,fmt(v,1),'white');x+=w;});});s+=result.names.map((n,j)=>'<rect x="'+(15+j*124)+'" y="'+(rows.length*62+20)+'" width="12" height="12" fill="'+colors[j]+'"/>'+txt(32+j*124,rows.length*62+31,n)).join('');s+=txt(115,16,'0')+txt(395,16,'50')+txt(680,16,'100 质量%');return svg(s,'六项产品组成比较',rows.length*62+65);}
function renderLesson(){$('#background-content').innerHTML=L.manifest.tabs.background.sections.map(s=>'<article class="chapter"><h2>'+s.title+'</h2>'+s.html+'</article>').join('');$('#workflow-content').innerHTML=L.manifest.tabs.workflow.steps.map((s,i)=>'<article class="chapter flow-step"><div class="step-number">步骤 '+(i+1)+'</div><h2>'+s.name+'</h2><p>'+s.do+'</p><p><b>本步得到：</b>'+s.effect+'</p>'+L.figures[i]+'<p class="note">需要留意：'+s.trap+'</p></article>').join('');}
function updateOutputs(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]').forEach(x=>x.nextElementSibling.textContent=x.value);}
function run(){setStatus('running','正在拟合训练批次并计算…');try{result=E.run(params());$('#results').hidden=false;draw();setStatus('complete','计算完成 · '+result.split.train+'批训练 / '+result.split.test+'批独立评价 · '+result.dataNature);}catch(e){setStatus('error','计算失败：'+e.message);}}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('nav [data-tab]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));['background','workflow','lab'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id).hidden=id!==b.dataset.tab);}));document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]').forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('input',()=>{updateOutputs();if(result)setStatus('stale','参数已改变，旧结果待更新 · 请点击重新计算');}));$('#run').addEventListener('click',run);$('#reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]').forEach(x=>x.value=x.defaultValue);updateOutputs();run();});$('#export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(status!=='complete')return;let a=document.createElement('a'),url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify({caseId:L.manifest.id,status,exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),...result},null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));a.href=url;a.download=scene+'-result.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);});globalThis.CaseInspect={snapshot:()=>({sceneId:scene,status,params:params(),result})};renderLesson();updateOutputs();
function testChart(){let r=result,row=r.predictions[+$('#test-batch').value||0];$('#test-chart').innerHTML='<p>'+row.id+'：温度 '+fmt(row.x.temperature,1)+'°C，剂油比 '+fmt(row.x.ratio,2)+'，原料密度 '+fmt(row.x.density,1)+' kg/m³</p>'+barComparison(row.prediction,row.baseline,row.truth);}
function draw(){let r=result;$('#composition-chart').innerHTML=barComparison(r.prediction,r.baseline);$('#summary').innerHTML='<p>六项合计 <b>'+fmt(r.prediction.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0),4)+'%</b>，闭合误差 '+r.closure.toExponential(1)+' 个百分点；各项均≥0。汽油预测 <b>'+fmt(r.prediction[2])+'%</b>，原料类别均值 '+fmt(r.baseline[2])+'%。</p><p class="note">组成闭合是一项约束，不等于预测准确；下方独立测试检验每项误差。</p>';
let vals=r.sensitivity.map(p=>p.y[2]),lo=Math.floor(Math.min(...vals,r.prediction[2]))-1,hi=Math.ceil(Math.max(...vals,r.prediction[2]))+1,x=t=>70+(t-500)*12.6,y=v=>260-(v-lo)/(hi-lo)*220,s='<path d="M70 25V260H700" stroke="#9ab0a9" fill="none"/>';for(let t=500;t<=550;t+=10)s+=txt(x(t)-12,286,t);for(let v=lo;v<=hi;v+=1)s+=txt(25,y(v)+5,v);s+='<path d="'+r.sensitivity.map((p,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+x(p.temperature)+' '+y(p.y[2])).join(' ')+'" fill="none" stroke="#298477" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M'+x(r.params.temperature)+' 30V260" stroke="#be773c" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><circle cx="'+x(r.params.temperature)+'" cy="'+y(r.prediction[2])+'" r="6" fill="#be773c"/>'+txt(290,321,'反应温度 / °C')+txt(75,20,'汽油质量收率 / %');$('#sensitivity-chart').innerHTML=svg(s,'当前原料与剂油比下的汽油温度响应');
$('#validation').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>产品</th><th>回归MAE / 百分点</th><th>类别均值MAE / 百分点</th><th>批次</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+r.metrics.map(m=>'<tr><th>'+m.name+'</th><td>'+fmt(m.mae,3)+'</td><td>'+fmt(m.baselineMAE,3)+'</td><td>'+m.n+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';$('#test-batch').innerHTML=r.predictions.map((row,i)=>'<option value="'+i+'">'+row.id+'</option>').join('');testChart();}
$('#test-batch').addEventListener('change',()=>{if(result)testChart();});
})();
(function(g){'use strict';
function mount(root=document){root.querySelectorAll('.case-flow-overview').forEach(chart=>{
 if(chart.dataset.flowMounted)return;chart.dataset.flowMounted='true';
 const area=chart.closest('#workflow')||chart.closest('main')||root;
 const targets=()=>[...area.querySelectorAll('[data-sr-step],[data-step]')].filter(e=>!e.closest('.case-flow-overview'));
 const chapters=()=>area.querySelectorAll('#workflow-content>article,.flow-step,.workflow-step');
 const select=n=>{chart.querySelectorAll('[data-flow-step]').forEach(el=>el.setAttribute('aria-current',String(+el.dataset.flowStep===n)));};
 const go=el=>{const n=+el.dataset.flowStep,b=targets().find(b=>+(b.dataset.srStep??b.dataset.step)===n);if(b)b.click();else chapters()[n]?.scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'auto'});select(n);};
 chart.querySelectorAll('[data-flow-step]').forEach(el=>{el.setAttribute('role','button');el.setAttribute('tabindex','0');el.setAttribute('aria-label','查看步骤 '+(+el.dataset.flowStep+1)+'：'+el.textContent.trim());});
 chart.querySelector('[data-flow-instruction]').textContent=' 点击图中节点，可查看对应步骤。';
 chart.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-flow-step]');if(el)go(el);});
 chart.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' ')&&e.target.matches('[data-flow-step]')){e.preventDefault();go(e.target);}});
 area.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-sr-step],[data-step]');if(b)select(+(b.dataset.srStep??b.dataset.step));});
 const current=targets().find(b=>b.matches('[aria-selected=true],[aria-pressed=true],.active'));select(+(current?.dataset.srStep??current?.dataset.step??0));
 });}
g.S17Flow={mount};
})(globalThis);

